Package: mlmr
Title: Mixed-Effects and Multilevel Models in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcus", "Harris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "marcus.harris.uconn@gmail.com")
Author: Marcus Harris [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Marcus Harris <marcus.harris.uconn@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a guided Shiny interface and reusable R helpers for
    specifying, fitting, explaining, and reporting mixed-effects and multilevel
    models with 'lme4'. The package supports centering decisions, nested and
    flexible random-effects structures, interaction terms, level-by-level and
    combined equations, APA-style tables, diagnostics, reproducible code, and
    software citation support for manuscript workflows.
